ValueSet: MII_VS_Mikrobio_LOINC_Ontology_Susceptibility_Phenotype
Id: mii-vs-mikrobio-loinc-ontology-susceptibility-phenotype
Title: "MII VS Microbiology LOINC Ontology Susceptibility Phenotype"
Description: "Proposal: LOINC codes of the microbiology request 'Susceptibility: Phenotypic susceptibility — isolate, not genotyping', computed by ECL over the LOINC Ontology 2026-10-21. Susceptibility of a microbial isolate to a substance, excluding observables that assert a genotyping technique (ECL cardinality [0..0]). Matches the phenotype ValueSet intent (MIC, disk diffusion, gradient strip ... any phenotypic method). Parts: LOINC enumeration (1230, LOINC 2.83), LOINC Ontology observables without LOINC code (0), and the ECL as an intensional include. ECL: `<< 363787002 |Observable entity (observable entity)| : 370130000 |Property (attribute)| = 118588007 |Susceptibility (property) (qualifier value)|, 704327008 |Direct site (attribute)| = << 119303007 |Microbial isolate specimen (specimen)|, [0..0] 246501002 |Technique (attribute)| = << 708060009 |Genotype determination technique (qualifier value)|`"
* insert PR_CS_VS_Version
* insert Publisher
* insert SnomedLicense
* ^status = #draft
* ^experimental = true
* ^date = "2026-11-03"
* ^purpose = "Guidance for binding Observation.code of the MII microbiology request profiles to a computably defined LOINC set; accompanies ballot comments on 2027.0.0-ballot2. Generated, not hand-curated."
