// The rule itself: intensional include, expandable only on a terminology server that
// holds the LOINC Ontology release named by the alias
* include codes from system $sct-loinc-ontology where constraint = "<< 363787002 |Observable entity (observable entity)| : 370130000 |Property (attribute)| = 118588007 |Susceptibility (property) (qualifier value)|, 704327008 |Direct site (attribute)| = << 119303007 |Microbial isolate specimen (specimen)|, [0..0] 246501002 |Technique (attribute)| = << 708060009 |Genotype determination technique (qualifier value)|"
